企业创建者 &amp; 企业管理员</h2>\n\n          <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">\n            一、通讯录管理（企业组织架构）\n            <span class=\"badge blue\">企业版</span>\n          </h3>\n\n          <p class=\"feature-intro\">企业创建者和企业管理员能够进行各种成员管理操作，包括：</p>\n\n          <ul class=\"features\">\n            <li>添加新成员</li>\n            <li>移除成员</li>\n            <li>设置成员所在部门</li>\n            <li>添加子部门</li>\n            <li>搜索成员</li>\n            <li>查看企业组织架构目录树</li>\n            <li>禁用成员账户</li>\n          </ul>\n\n          <figure class=\"placeholder ui-shot\">\n            <div class=\"ui-top\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ui-left\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ui-content\"></div>\n            <figcaption class=\"ui-caption\">[Screenshot: centered]</figcaption>\n          </figure>\n\n          <section class=\"second-section\">\n            <h3 class=\"subsection-title\">\n              二、禁用账号与离职员工管理<span class=\"badge red\">企业高级版</span>\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"second-description\">支持离职员工账号内容冻结与交接</p>\n          </section>\n        </div>\n      </main>\n\n      <aside class=\"right-panel\">\n        <div class=\"toc-wrap\">\n          <h2 class=\"toc-title\">目录</h2>\n          <div class=\"toc\">\n            <div class=\"toc-current\">面向企业创建者 &amp; 企业管理员</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-item\">一、通讯录管理（企业组织架构）</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-item\">二、禁用账号与离职员工管理</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-item\">三、查看操作日志</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-item\">四、企业安全管控</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-item\">五、内容外泄预防与管控</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-item\">六、文件安全预警</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-item\">七、效能看板</div>\n            <div class=\"toc-next\">《石墨文档「进阶教程指南」》</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"feedback\">\n          <div class=\"feedback-question\">你觉得本文档有帮助吗？</div>\n          <div class=\"feedback-buttons\">\n            <div class=\"feedback-button\"><span class=\"thumb up\"></span>有帮助</div>\n           